<ol class="engagement-steps" aria-label="From inquiry to delivery">
  <li><strong>01 / Consultation</strong><p>Tell us about one repeated task and the result you want.</p></li>
  <li><strong>02 / Review</strong><p>We clarify your process, tools, constraints and priorities with you.</p></li>
  <li><strong>03 / Proposal &amp; estimate</strong><p>You receive a proposed scope, deliverables, schedule and fee.</p></li>
  <li><strong>04 / Agreement</strong><p>You approve the scope and terms before paid work begins.</p></li>
  <li><strong>05 / Build &amp; validate</strong><p>We develop the agreed workflow and test it against agreed examples and quality criteria.</p></li>
  <li><strong>06 / Delivery</strong><p>You receive the agreed deliverables, test results and guidance for using them. Ongoing support is scoped separately.</p></li>
</ol>
<style>.engagement-steps{list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px 48px;grid-column:1/-1;margin:36px 0}.engagement-steps li{border-top:1px solid var(--glass-border);padding-top:18px}.engagement-steps strong{font:14px/1.6 var(--font-explanation);color:var(--moonlight)}.engagement-steps p{font:16px/1.8 var(--font-explanation);color:var(--moonlight);margin:12px 0 0}@media(max-width:700px){.engagement-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}}</style>
